#. ja: ようこそ、工芸「フェン・イル」へ！
#. de: Willkommen beim Atelier Fen-Yll!
#. fr: Bienvenue aux Atours de Fen-Yll<nbsp>!
#. column 21: ...if you had an order placed, that is. We only deal in bespoke items, you see.
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589964:0:20"
msgid "Welcome to Fen<hyphen>Yll Fineries! It would be my pleasure to serve you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>..."
msgstr "Добро пожаловать в мастерскую Фен-Ил! Буду рад услужить вам, <if $gn4>миледи<else>милорду</if>..."

#. ja: あ、お客さん、予約の方じゃない？<br>悪いね、ウチは受注生産しかしてないんだ。
#. de: Hast du etwas bestellt? Wenn nicht, muss ich dich enttäuschen. Wir produzieren nur nach Auftrag.
#. fr: À ce que je vois, vous n'avez pas passé de commande. Toutes mes excuses, mais nous ne produisons qu'à la demande.
#. column 20: Welcome to Fen<hyphen>Yll Fineries! It would be my pleasure to serve you, <if $gn4>milady<else>milord</if>...
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589964:0:21"
msgid "...if you had an order placed, that is. We only deal in bespoke items, you see."
msgstr "...если бы вы оформили заказ. Мы ведь работаем только на заказ."

#. ja: ひっひっひ。<br>リムサ・ロミンサで捌けば、この3倍……<br>いや、4倍の値段で……
#. de: Haha, wenn ich das in Limsa Lominsa verkaufe, kann ich den dreifachen, ach was, den vierfachen Preis verlangen!
#. fr: Hi hi hi, je pourrais facilement en tirer trois à quatre fois ce prix en revendant tout ça à Limsa Lominsa<nbsp>!
#. column 21: H-Hey, what's that look for? I'm simply <i>considering</i> a purchase for...my mum! Y<hyphen>Yes, only the <i>finest</i> leathers for my <i>dearest</i> mum!
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589965:0:20"
msgid "...Aye! 'Tis the perfect plan! If I can just get the trim right, these “genuine Fen<hyphen>Yll fashions” will net me an Admiral's ransom back in Lims─"
msgstr "...Вот оно! План что надо! Подгоню отделку — и за эти «подлинные моды Фен-Йлла» в Лимсе мне отвалят адмиральский выкуп!"

#. ja: ……おっと、口に出てました？<br>いえいえ、私は何もやましいことなど<br>考えていませんよ。
#. de: ... Ups, habe ich das etwa laut gesagt?<br>Vergiss das schnell wieder!
#. fr: Mince<nbsp>! J'ai pensé à voix haute<nbsp>? Vous n'avez rien entendu<nbsp>! Je ne ferais jamais rien de ré<shy>pré<shy>hen<shy>si<shy>ble, voyons<nbsp>!
#. column 20: ...Aye! 'Tis the perfect plan! If I can just get the trim right, these “genuine Fen<hyphen>Yll fashions” will net me an Admiral's ransom back in Lims─
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <hyphen> — a hyphen that does not break the line (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589965:0:21"
msgid "H-Hey, what's that look for? I'm simply <i>considering</i> a purchase for...my mum! Y<hyphen>Yes, only the <i>finest</i> leathers for my <i>dearest</i> mum!"
msgstr "Э-эй, чего уставились? Я просто <i>приглядываю</i> покупку для... мамы! Д-да, только <i>самые лучшие</i> кожи для моей <i>дорогой</i> мамочки!"

#. ja: ようこそ。<br>こちらはリテイナー受付窓口です。
#. de: Willkommen an der Rezeption für Gehilfen.
#. fr: Bienvenue au comptoir des servants.
#. column 21: My sincerest apologies, but we currently have no retainers available for hire.
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589966:0:20"
msgid "Greetings, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>. Might you be looking to secure the services of a retainer?"
msgstr "Здравствуйте. Не желаете нанять слугу?"

#. ja: 申し訳ありませんが、現在ご案内を休止しています。
#. de: Ich bitte um Verzeihung, aber unser Vermittlungsservice pausiert zurzeit.
#. fr: Nous vous présentons toutes nos excuses. Nous sommes fermés pour le moment.
#. column 20: Greetings, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>. Might you be looking to secure the services of a retainer?
#. column 22: 0
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589966:0:21"
msgid "My sincerest apologies, but we currently have no retainers available for hire."
msgstr "Приношу глубочайшие извинения, но сейчас нанять слуг не получится."

#. ja: わたしはリテイナーボードの案内をしています。
#. de: Wenn du Interesse hast, erkläre ich dir die Gehilfen-Tafel.
#. fr: Vous avez des questions concernant les servants<nbsp>?
#. column 21: 0
#. column 22: 0
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:589967:0:20"
msgid "Greetings, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>. Please feel free to use the market board to search for any items you desire."
msgstr "Здравствуйте. Не стесняйтесь пользоваться рынком, чтобы найти всё, что вам нужно."

